      "id": 252962,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-06-27T16:28:24.219Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If it’s over an hour, it ain’t “short”. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\"> (Okay, but it certainly <em>felt</em> short!)</p>\n<p>Adam was clearly in a <em>mood</em> for this opening, which I appreciate, because I was in the opposite mood and needed cheering up. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> Thanks, Adam.</p>\n<p>Space Mouse? You mean the long-lost cosmic cousin of Gun Rat???</p>\n<p>THE ANIMEVERSE?!?! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> This is delightful! And since they note this is her first appearance, does that mean we’ll be seeing K.U.N.A.I. again??</p>\n<p>Rockabilly to psychobilly, fantastic, perfect logic. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>I can, of course, only speak for myself, but I feel like finding out why/how he ended up in the brig fulfills the prompt, full stop.</p>\n<p>God, I love enemies who compliment each other the whole fight. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> Even better when they’re versions of the same character!</p>\n<p>I’m glad he brought up “Audio” starting with “A”, it also bothers me lol</p>\n<p>Cannot believe they just jumped into VC while recording. XD Classic.</p>",
