      "raw": "If it's over an hour, it ain't \"short\". :P (Okay, but it certainly *felt* short!)\n\nAdam was clearly in a *mood* for this opening, which I appreciate, because I was in the opposite mood and needed cheering up. :) Thanks, Adam.\n\nSpace Mouse? You mean the long-lost cosmic cousin of Gun Rat???\n\nTHE ANIMEVERSE?!?! :D This is delightful! And since they note this is her first appearance, does that mean we'll be seeing K.U.N.A.I. again??\n\nRockabilly to psychobilly, fantastic, perfect logic. :D\n\nI can, of course, only speak for myself, but I feel like finding out why/how he ended up in the brig fulfills the prompt, full stop.\n\nGod, I love enemies who compliment each other the whole fight. :D Even better when they're versions of the same character!\n\nI'm glad he brought up \"Audio\" starting with \"A\", it also bothers me lol\n\nCannot believe they just jumped into VC while recording. XD Classic.",
