      "username": "OddballPaladin",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/d26b3c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2023-06-28T01:48:31.777Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Anyone else, when they mention “XTreme-verse Greezer” thought “Blue skinned Lobo”?</p>\n<p>Well, Ninja Knyfe is definitely a variant at some point.</p>\n<p>Agree, seems like we’re getting a Greezer hero deck of some sort. Very few of the stories about him have been in an antagonistic position. That said, I wonder where he would fit in. Of course, since we got Harpy early, and will probably get Akash and La Commodora sooner than Obliv, so maybe Greezer will be the a new “last minute redemption” deck.</p>",
