      "username": "Dil_Ninja",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dil_ninja/{size}/5218_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-06-28T04:12:02.550Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So KUNAI’s art style doesn’t seem too out of place compared to Greazer or other Sentinels characters, in contrast to the Mangaverse cover we got a while back, which looked pretty distinct. Does the Mangaverse just turn everything that enters it into anime artstyle, and those characters look different when they exit that universe?</p>\n<p>As far as a Greazer hero deck goes, I will say each expansion so far includes 5 existing hero decks + 1 new hero. Across the 3 future expansions, there are 15 existing decks remaining, and 3 major candidates for new heroes: Rambler, Fashion, and Young Legacy. So if the pattern holds, then we know all the pieces already. Though there’s no guarantee the pattern will hold, especially once we get to OblivAeon.</p>\n<p>Maybe the teaser was more for what Greazer is doing in the RPG? He gets attached to his time-displaced crewmates and is now trying to find a way to puncture the sandwich bag and bring back La Commodora?</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
